{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行超大的白色标题；随后下方同样醒目的大字段落和紫色强调词吸引视线。上下两块都很突出，右侧目录和下方音符动画相对次要。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"大致看出他处于一段亲密关系中，渴望对方承诺以后不变，却担心相处不能长久；具体的处境变化不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、害怕失去、担心受伤；隐约看到想收起心意的矛盾。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他从害怕自己的需要成为对方的负担，转变为更害怕对方不再需要自己；想少表达心意来避免受伤，但真正把心意藏回去反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方标题和下方大字段落都很显眼，存在两个主视线入口。\",\n    \"下方单块文字较长，包含处境变化、内心担忧、应对想法和反效果多个层次。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块：上方表达对关系能否长久的担忧，下方才具体交代害怕不被需要及隐藏心意的痛苦，需要拼接才能完整理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "488320b8-5c66-46f1-af63-43460a2f29d8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022052601065Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:21:31.867234+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a207b51171b4e76ddaee60bfbc745b95ae18e228dd87160bad2fd9e1c7a13b1a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1ef